                            <comment id="15827967" author="dkarachentsev" created="Wed, 18 Jan 2017 12:23:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Denis,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I suppose to filter property keys with condition: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;key.startsWith(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;IGNITE_&quot;&lt;/span&gt;) || key.startsWith(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;java.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
                || key.startsWith(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;sun.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;) || key.startsWith(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;os.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
                || key.startsWith(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;file.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;) || key.startsWith(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;user.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
                || &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;path.separator&quot;&lt;/span&gt;.equals(key)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is it OK or we should make it more strict and hardcode some standard properties?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15828778" author="dmagda" created="Wed, 18 Jan 2017 21:12:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In general, OS and Java version should be enough. However, let me think over a bit.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15830207" author="dmagda" created="Thu, 19 Jan 2017 16:29:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Well, let&apos;s pass all the properties that start with &quot;java.&quot;, &quot;os.&quot; and &quot;user.&quot;. The rest can be skipped.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15836137" author="dkarachentsev" created="Tue, 24 Jan 2017 13:43:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1459&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;PR#1459&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15851255" author="sboikov" created="Fri, 3 Feb 2017 09:19:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
